From: Xiangzhe <xiangzhedev@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] config: disable telemetry by default

The Gentoo package is built with DISABLE_TELEMETRY, so keep the installed
configuration consistent with the compiled feature set.

--- a/etc/et.cfg
+++ b/etc/et.cfg
@@ -10,4 +10,4 @@ verbose = 0
 silent = 0
 logsize = 20971520
-telemetry = true
+telemetry = false
 logdirectory = /tmp
